WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.009
A password alone no longer opens the admin console. Staff now confirm it's them,

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:09.125
with a code from their phone.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.043
After the password, staff open their authenticator app and enter the six-digit code.

00:00:15.043 --> 00:00:19.665
While it's checked, the button says Verifying, then the Dashboard opens.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.775
A wrong code is said under the field, which keeps what was typed and takes focus.

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:28.553
Codes change every thirty seconds, so enter the newest one.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.392
After five wrong codes in fifteen minutes, the sign-in ends. Wait more than five

00:00:34.392 --> 00:00:37.053
minutes, and you're asked to sign in again.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.539
Staff without an authenticator are told to ask an Admin, who sets one up with a

00:00:44.539 --> 00:00:45.701
single command.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.380
On the server, the right password starts no session, only a short pending sign-in. A

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:57.587
used code is refused, and no code or secret is ever recorded.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.922
Every test failed first. Now they all pass.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.102
Next, idle sessions expire.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.051
That's slice nine point two. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health in

00:01:15.051 --> 00:01:16.325
body and spirit.
